<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>A-CODEAI | Enterprise Macro Risk Warning</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Enterprise macro risk early warning for treasury teams. Transparent KPI, known limits, and compensation terms."
  />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #081022;
      --bg-soft: #0f1a33;
      --panel: #121f3d;
      --text: #edf2ff;
      --muted: #a7b6d8;
      --line: #263a66;
      --primary: #86abff;
      --primary-dark: #0a1738;
      --ok: #7ff0c3;
      --warn: #ffd27a;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 80% -10%, #173063 0%, transparent 60%), linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), #0b1733 55%, #0d1c3f);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .container { width: min(1080px, 92vw); margin: 0 auto; }
    .topbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      background: color-mix(in oklab, #071024 84%, transparent);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      z-index: 10;
    }
    .topbar-inner {
      min-height: 58px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .brand { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
    .lang { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .hero { padding: 72px 0 44px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .badge-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .badge {
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--panel), black 8%);
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4.6vw, 56px);
      line-height: 1.06;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      max-width: 820px;
    }
    .subtitle {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 19px;
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 0 26px;
    }
    .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 10px;
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(122, 162, 255, 0.25);
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      border-color: var(--line);
      background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--panel), black 6%);
    }
    section { padding: 42px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--panel), black 8%);
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .label {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .kpi { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; }
    .small { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
    ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted); }
    .trust-list { display: grid; gap: 10px; margin: 14px 0 0; }
    .trust-item {
      border: 1px dashed var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
      background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--bg-soft), black 2%);
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .pill { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-right: 6px; }
    .pill-ok { background: var(--ok); color: #102317; }
    .pill-warn { background: var(--warn); color: #2a1e00; }
    .legal {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--bg-soft), black 4%);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .final-cta {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: center;
      background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--panel), black 8%);
    }
    footer { padding: 24px 0 36px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .focus-link:focus-visible,
    .btn:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--primary);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="topbar" aria-label="Top navigation">
    <div class="container topbar-inner">
      <div class="brand">A-CODEAI</div>
      <div class="lang">Language: <strong>EN</strong> | <a class="focus-link" href="/ko/">KO</a></div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="badge">Enterprise Treasury Focus</span>
        <span class="badge">Not Investment Advice</span>
        <span class="badge">Paid 90-Day Pilot</span>
      </div>
      <h1>When macro risk moves fast, your team needs lead time, not noise.</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        A-CODEAI provides early warning signals for FX, commodity, and supply-chain shocks,
        with transparent KPI, known limitations, and compensation terms built into the pilot.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/pilot">View 90-day pilot</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/benchmark">View benchmark policy</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#contact">Book a 20-min call</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="fit">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Who this is for</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card">
            <p class="label">Ideal Buyer</p>
            <p class="small">CFO, Treasury, and Risk teams at firms exposed to cross-border volatility.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <p class="label">Use Cases</p>
            <p class="small">FX exposure monitoring, commodity shock alerts, and faster risk committee decisions.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <p class="label">Delivery</p>
            <p class="small">Weekly brief, threshold alerts, and monthly review with wins and misses together.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="trust">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Why teams pay for this</h2>
        <div class="trust-list">
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="pill pill-ok">Risk Reversal</span> KPI misses trigger pre-defined credit/extension terms.</div>
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="pill pill-ok">No Black Box</span> You see false positives and misses, not only success stories.</div>
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="pill pill-ok">Procurement-Ready</span> Scope, metric, compensation, and legal notice are contract-ready from day one.</div>
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="pill pill-warn">Known Limits</span> Uncertainty is explicitly disclosed, not hidden.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pilot">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Commercial terms at a glance</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card">
            <p class="label">Monthly Fee</p>
            <p class="kpi">KRW 4,900,000</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <p class="label">Event Alert</p>
            <p class="kpi">KRW 250,000</p>
            <p class="small">Per event, capped at KRW 2,000,000/month</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <p class="label">Minimum Term</p>
            <p class="kpi">90 Days</p>
            <p class="small">KRW 14,700,000 minimum contract value</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="benchmark">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Verification policy</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card">
            <p class="label">Transparency</p>
            <p class="small">Wins and misses are reported together every month.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <p class="label">Reproducibility</p>
            <p class="small">Repro commands and evidence paths are disclosed for audit.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <p class="label">Limits</p>
            <p class="small">False positives/misses can occur; uncertainty is disclosed upfront.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-list" style="margin-top:14px">
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="pill pill-ok">Commercial Readiness</span> `l1_inverse_decoder_commercialization_checklist_v1.json` reports <strong>READY_FOR_BROAD_ROLLOUT</strong> (3/3 criteria passed).</div>
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="pill pill-ok">Hard-Case Gain</span> In `swap_typo` stress mode, objective v4 improves both exact and recovery by <strong>+0.0667</strong>.</div>
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="pill pill-ok">Safety Control</span> Improved path is default-on, with immediate rollback via `--disable-swap-typo-objective-v4`.</div>
          <div class="trust-item"><span class="pill pill-warn">Fit Boundary</span> Best for meaning-centric workloads (summarization, search, logs). For 100% fidelity workloads (payments/legal originals), use the literal-preserve lane.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="final-cta">
          <div>
            <h2 style="margin-bottom:8px">Start with one 20-minute decision call</h2>
            <p class="small">We align scope, KPI, compensation terms, and the first pilot start date.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-row" style="margin:0">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:contact@a-codeai.com?subject=%5BCompany%5D%2090-day%20macro%20risk%20pilot%20inquiry">Email us</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/pilot">Pilot details</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container legal">
        <strong>Legal notice</strong>
        <p>
          A-CODEAI is a risk monitoring information service. It is not investment advisory,
          portfolio management, or trade recommendation. Final decision responsibility remains with the client.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>A-CODEAI · Engineering-grade risk monitoring for enterprise treasury teams.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
